<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Embrace It</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Ndotz</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Embrace It</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0io16MKpbeDIdYzmGpQaES</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.509" end="00:03.009">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.278" end="00:04.507">She bad 'mmmh' I like this (like this)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.507" end="00:06.455">Cowgirl now she wanna ride it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.455" end="00:08.415">Face card valid and she got nice lips</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.415" end="00:10.934">Innocent and a freak, that's my type shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.934" end="00:12.638">10/10 yeah that's my bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.638" end="00:14.672">If you like tiktok, tick tock like this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.672" end="00:16.679">I know when you are on don't try hide it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.679" end="00:18.675">Bad gyal move your waist somewhere like this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.675" end="00:20.175" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.867" end="00:20.367">[Verse]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.009" end="00:20.940">Face, card valid and her body come perfect</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.940" end="00:23.174">I can be patient if it's worth it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.174" end="00:25.216">If you want a burgin then earn it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.216" end="00:27.510">Miss we can make fire like furnace</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.510" end="00:29.769">You pull up on me in the night with a purpose</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.769" end="00:31.491">And your eye contact is flirting (mmh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.491" end="00:33.683">You got the wap, I'm surfing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.683" end="00:36.068">Miss, if you got a bumper then twerk it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.068" end="00:38.014">Miss if you got a bumper then shake it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.014" end="00:39.514">Vibrate it (vibrate it)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.229" end="00:40.729">Embrace it (embrace it)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.374" end="00:41.949">If you want a baby let's make it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.949" end="00:43.964">First step room, next step get naked (woop, woo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.964" end="00:45.925">I got a henny' are you tryna' get wasted?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.925" end="00:48.173">If you can't handle, come take it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.173" end="00:50.175">I know that your friends like me and you hate it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.175" end="00:52.054">Baby you can look, not touch and taste it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.054" end="00:53.554">Only you (only you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.119" end="00:54.619">And me (and me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.264" end="00:56.433">Come body I don't like party (aha)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.433" end="00:58.262">But we can party, like we at carney</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.262" end="01:00.497">First day throw it back, throw it back for me (for me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.497" end="01:01.997">Only you (only you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.837" end="01:03.337">And me (and me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.317" end="01:04.817">Let's do body on body</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.780" end="01:06.598">She don't need harney, she already on it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.598" end="01:08.098">If you bring your girls, I'mma bring my army</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.063" end="01:09.563" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.344" end="01:09.844">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.699" end="01:10.904">She bad 'mmmh' I like this (like this)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.904" end="01:12.972">Cowgirl now she wanna ride it (ride it)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.972" end="01:15.323">Face card valid and she got nice lips (nice lips)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.323" end="01:17.064">Innocent and a freak, that's my type shit (type shit)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.064" end="01:19.158">10/10 yeah that's my bitch (my bitch)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.158" end="01:21.042">If you like tiktok, tick tock like this (like this)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.042" end="01:23.264">I know when you are on don't try hide it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.264" end="01:25.417">Bad gyal move your waist somewhere like this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.417" end="01:27.697">She bad 'mmmh' I like this (like this)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.697" end="01:29.656">Cowgirl now she wanna ride it (face car)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.656" end="01:31.649">Face card valid and she got nice lips</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.649" end="01:33.730">Innocent and a freak, that's my type shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.730" end="01:35.832">10/10 yeah that's my bitch (my bitch)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.832" end="01:37.897">If you like tiktok, tick tock like this (aha)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.897" end="01:39.814">I know when you are on don't try hide it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.814" end="01:43.814">Bad gyal move your waist somewhere like this</p></div></body></tt>